            "review_title": "Review at Seashell Cafe & Restaurant Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Lona\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nPerfect moment\nNov 2023 • Family\nThe front of the restaurant has a beautiful and poetic sea view of Troing city, suitable for enjoying seafood dishes or having coffee or tea with family or friends.\nThe shop's design follows the ocean concept and is decorated with sea creatures such as starfish and seahorses. The special thing is that high-value handicrafts such as snail shells are decorated meticulously\nThe food is beautifully presented and fresh. The price is average but overall it is reasonable compared to the amount of food on the plate\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten December 8, 2023",
